    "Name": "Araña 1",
    "Details": "The Araña is fitted with nine-and-a-half tons of heavy industrial armor. Its quadruped leg configuration also gives it considerable stability as it traverses rough terrain and added stability for MechWarriors. The 'Mech is powered by a 200-rated fusion engine, giving the Araña sufficient mobility for it to keep up with supporting forces. Mounted on a turret in the right torso are three Clan-produced ER Medium Lasers.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.75</color></b>",
